cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use formalize-paper, please cite it as below."
title: "formalize-paper: formalize a mathematics paper in Lean 4 with an audit trail"
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code skill and audit apparatus that formalizes a mathematics paper in Lean 4 and
  Mathlib and audits the formalization with single-criterion AI reviewers, producing a defect
  record, a PDF report and a statement-by-statement sign-off sheet.
type: software
authors:
